# Work With Me

I work directly with founders and marketing teams of high-growth e-commerce brands to unlock revenue trapped by poor deliverability and unoptimized flows.

## 1. Free Email Audit ($0)
A deep-dive audit of your domain authentication (SPF, DKIM, DMARC), inbox placement rates, and core Klaviyo automations.

## 2. Retention Strategy & Flow Rebuilds
End-to-end architecture and copywriting for high-converting welcome flows, abandoned cart sequences, and post-purchase customer journeys.

## 3. Dedicated Advisory
Ongoing strategic guidance and monthly deliverability monitoring to ensure your emails consistently hit the primary inbox.
